      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fairy Zi Wei recalls that Reckless Savage Demon Venerable’s central path passes Immortal Emperor Court, Hidden Space Pavilion, Sumeru Lake, Eternal Sand Cave, Million Heavenly King Gallery, Embroidered Tower, Central Great Hall, and ends at Heaven Overseeing Tower.",
      "chapters": [
        1710
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
