    },
    {
      "text": "Bing Sai Chuan says Shabi Ninety-five resides in Eternal Sand Cave and was deployed by Heavenly Court to fight Longevity Heaven on the left path.",
      "chapters": [
        1712
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
