    {
      "text": "Over a million years ago, Reckless Savage Demon Venerable invaded Heavenly Court and stormed through it, passing Immortal Emperor Court, Hidden Space Pavilion, Sumeru Lake, then Eternal Sand Cave, then Million Heavenly King Gallery and the later nodes, and finally stopping at Heaven Overseeing Tower.",
